# The Grid API. No default in code - a missing value fails loudly rather than
# silently pointing a production console at staging.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.gridmarketplace.in

# The console's secret path segment, read by middleware.ts at request time.
#
# NOT prefixed VITE_, deliberately: only VITE_* variables reach the browser
# bundle, so this one never does. Set it in Vercel's project settings, never
# in a committed file.
#
# Unset means the console is unreachable, not open - middleware.ts 404s every
# admin-shaped path rather than falling back to serving it.
ADMIN_PATH_SEGMENT=change-me-to-something-unguessable
